flowchart LR
 P[用户密码] --> KDF[独立盐 密码KDF]
 KDF --> V[密码验证值]
 KDF --> KEK[KEK]
 UMK[随机用户主密钥] --> Wrap[AES-GCM封套]
 KEK --> Wrap
 Wrap --> DP1[DPAPI CurrentUser]
 DP1 --> Catalog[UserKeyEnvelope]
 UMK --> Cred[AES-GCM绑定用户与账号的凭据]
 Cred --> DP2[DPAPI CurrentUser]
 DP2 --> DB[AuthCredential.dpapi_cipher]
